## ======================================================================
## Root .gitignore — Multi-Vendor Marketplace (Monorepo)
## Covers: .NET 10 Backend + React 19 / Vite Frontend
## ======================================================================

## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
## AI Agent & Internal Tool Caches (never commit)
## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
.agents/
.archify/
GEMINI.md
.gemini/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
.copilot/
.aider*
CLAUDE.md
ROADMAP.md

## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
## .NET & Visual Studio Build Artifacts
## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.log

# Visual Studio temporary files, caches, user options
.vs/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj

# JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# VS Code (keep shared settings, ignore personal overrides)
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
## Environment & Sensitive Configuration
## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Production.json
*.env
*.env.local
.env
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example

## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
## User Uploaded Files & Media
## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Retain folder structure via .gitkeep; ignore actual uploads
Backend/Multi-Vendor Marketplace.Api/wwwroot/uploads/**/*
!Backend/Multi-Vendor Marketplace.Api/wwwroot/uploads/**/.gitkeep

## -----------------------------------------------------------------------
